  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1405.02 Operator Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1405.02 Operator Required.\n\n(a) Staffing of operators and attendants shall be in conformance with manufacturer’s requirements.\n\n(b) In the event that original manufacturer staffing information is not available, staffing of operators and attendants shall be as follows:\n\n(1) There shall be one authorized operator on site for each carnival or amusement ride in operation; and\n\n(2) The operator shall attend their assigned carnival or amusement ride and no other while the carnival or amusement ride is in operation.\n\n(c) Operators shall conform to the manufacturer’s requirements for operational personnel.\n\n(d) Notwithstanding (a)-(c) above, staffing of operators and attendants of challenge courses or zip lines shall conform to the standards set forth in either the “ANSI/ACCT 03-2019 CHALLENGE COURSES AND CANOPY/ZIP LINE TOURS STANDARDS” (Revision of ANSI/ACCT 03-2016 Standards), or the ASTM International standards listed in Saf-C 1402.01(a), available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #2229, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2950, eff 1-3-85; ss by #4531, eff 1-1-89; ss by #5940, INTERIM, eff 1-1-95; ss by #5952, eff 1-24-95; ss by #7618, eff 12-28-01; ss by #8342, eff 4-28-05, EXPIRED: 1-2-14 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)\n\nNew. #10507, eff 1-21-14; amd by #12615, eff 8-28-18; ss by #13666, eff 6-20-23; ss by #14139, eff 11-28-24, EXPIRES: 11-28-34 (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1400)",
